# Where the API keeps its files (logs, media, imports, ...) when it runs in Docker Compose. Set it to
# ./data, the folder an API started from the IDE uses, when the API runs from the IDE and the other containers
# (e.g. the media server) should see its files.
#API_DATA=./.docker/api
